	(gr_text "REAR PLATE: X mirrored vs front (outside view).\nOutline+M3 corner holes from enclosure DXF (88x38 R4.5, holes Ø3.4 @ +/-41,+/-14.21).\nConnector Y set from measured 7.9mm PCB rail height above enclosure floor (TOP edge, Y=0).\nSMA holes Ø7.0 at plate Y 7.90 (edge-launch, board plane).\nUSB opening 12.5x12.7 at plate Y 14.79 (bottom flush to board top surface; connector rises 12.2 into box).\nFloor = connector edge (top, Y=0).\nSMA: J1=RF IN J3=SPARE J2=TIMESYNC IN J4=EXT REF.\nOpen in KiCad 10 to confirm parse."
